Package: cfm-edge
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: cfm-edge builder <noreply@nixpal.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libpcre2-8-0, zlib1g, libmaxminddb0, logrotate, iproute2
Recommends: cfm, curl
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/chrismfz/cfm-edge
Description: CFM edge proxy: nginx with the CFM Lua stack
 nginx.org nginx with the OpenResty Lua set (LuaJIT2, lua-nginx-module,
 lua-resty-core and friends) and a static OpenSSL, packaged for CFM's
 in-path WAF, challenge and Site Cache. Installs to /usr/sbin/cfm-edge,
 /etc/cfm-edge and /var/log/cfm-edge, beside any other nginx.
 .
 The same binary as the EL rpm (built on EL8, glibc 2.28). The unit is not
 enabled: CFM's install-edge.sh prepares the edge and `cfm edge` puts it in
 the path.
